ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:

  With the advent of the spring season Hokuto set out to quench his thirst 
for glory.  He invented nothing in his sagely experiments.
  The wet spring was followed by early summer.  Hokuto discovered nothing in 
his sagely researches.
  In late summer, Hokuto discovered nothing in his sagely experiments.
  With the coming of the fall season, Hokuto discovered nothing in his 
sagely experiments.
  The fall season cooled into the stillness of early winter.  Hokuto 
invented nothing valuable in his sagely experiments.

  Thus endeth the adventures of Hokuto for this year.

  Mugai (#3) Treated with Hokuto, but Hokuto did not react favorably to his 
friendly overtures.  It is hoped that next year, both Kings will see the 
wisdom of Treating.


  Here is the financial report for Hokuto's kingdom: this turn, the Kingdom 
collected 0 gold in revenue.  0 gold was expended to finance our leaders.  0 
gold was expended to maintain our armies.  Hokuto was left with 16 gold in 
the treasury.


